\v 32 Mi wantem tumas
\q2 blong obei long ol tok we yu yu putum,
\q3 from we yu bambae yu mekem
\q4 mi mi save olgeta moa.
\s Prea blong man we i wantem kasem save
\sp (Tok i go long Hae God.)
