\v 40 Mi mi wantem tumas
\q2 blong obei long ol loa blong yu.
\q1 Plis yu mekem laef blong mi i kam niuwan,
\q2 from we fasin blong yu i stret gud.
\s Prea blong man we i trastem Loa blong Hae God
