\q2 from we mi stap traem
\q3 blong obei long ol loa blong yu.
\q1
\v 46 Bambae mi stanap long fes blong ol king,
\q2 mi talemaot ol rul we yu yu mekem,
\q3 we bambae mi no save sem from.
