\v 49 Hae God.
\q1 Mi mi man blong wok blong yu.
\q1 Plis yu tingbaot ol tok blong yu
\q3 we yu talem long mi,
\q2 from we hem i mekem
\q4 tingting blong mi i strong.
\q1
\v 50 Nating we mi mi harem nogud,
\q2 be yu yu mekem mi mi harem gud bakegen,
\q3 from we promes blong yu i mekem mi mi laef.
