\q2 mi stap tingting long hem
\q3 i stat long moning, gogo kasem sapa.
\q1
\v 98 Tok ya we yu yu putum
\q2 i stap oltaem long tingting blong mi,
\q3 i stap mekem mi mi waes moa,
